## Remaining work

Request 3008 is closed for the body and header states described above.
`listAcl` remains unimplemented. Broader Phase 18 settings, input, error,
control-flow, reverse-export, and platform reconciliation also remains open.
No Broker, Docker, or remote CI was used. Pre-existing Phase 19 worktree paths
remain unstaged and outside this slice.
